G.\" }"},{"id":"30000002827","value":"{ \"title\": \"Book of Meme (BOME)\", \"content\": \"$BOME  is a community driven meme coin on the  Solana ecosystem. As a meme token, its value may be derived only from continued market demand and trading activity, which may result in the potential for permanent and total loss of value if demand or trading ceases. The token may also be subject to extreme price volatility, in particular if large, concentrated holdings of $BOME are liquidated in a short period of time. By trading $BOME, you acknowledge that you have read this disclosure and understand the risks associated with trading $BOME.\" }"},{"id":"30000002851","value":"{\n  \"title\": \"Cat in a dogs world (MEW)\",\n  \"content\": \"$MEW is a community driven memecoin on the Solana ecosystem. As a meme token, its value may be derived only from continued market demand and trading activity, which may result in the potential for permanent and total loss of value if demand or trading ceases. The token may also be subject to extreme price volatility, in particular if large, concentrated holdings of $MEW are liquidated in a short period of time. By trading $MEW, you acknowledge that you have read this disclosure and understand the risks associated with trading $MEW.\"\n}"},{"id":"30000002853","value":"{\n  \"title\": \"Peanut the Squirrel (PNUT)\",\n  \"content\": \"$PNUT, launched in early November 2024, is a new community-driven memecoin on the Solana ecosystem. As a meme token, its value may be derived only from continued market demand and trading activity, which may result in the potential for permanent and total loss of value if demand or trading ceases.  The token may also be subject to extreme price volatility. By trading $PNUT you acknowledge that you have read this disclosure and understand the risks associated with trading $PNUT.\"\n}"},{"id":"30000002855","value":"{\n  \"title\": \"GOAT\",\n  \"content\": \"$GOAT launched in October 2024, is a new community driven memecoin on the Solana ecosystem. As a meme token, its value may be derived only from continued market demand and trading activity, which may result in the potential for permanent and total loss of value if demand or trading ceases.  The token may also be subject to extreme price volatility. By trading $GOAT you acknowledge that you have read this disclosure and understand the risks associated with trading $GOAT.\"\n}"},{"id":"30000002857","value":"{\n  \"title\": \"Trading $MOG\",\n  \"content\": \"Mog Coin ($MOG) is a community driven memecoin. As a meme token, its value may be derived only from continued market demand and trading activity, which may result in the potential for permanent and total loss of value should participants choose to no longer demand or trade $MOG. The token may also be subject to extreme price volatility. By trading $MOG, you acknowledge that you have read this disclosure and understand the risks associated with trading $MOG.\"\n}"},{"id":"30000002877","value":"{\n  \"title\": \"Trading $NEIRO\",\n  \"content\": \"Neiro ($NEIRO) is a community driven memecoin on the Ethereum ecosystem. As a meme token, its value may be derived only from continued market demand and trading activity, which may result in the potential for permanent and total loss of value should participants choose to no longer demand or trade $NEIRO. The token may also be subject to extreme price volatility. By trading $NEIRO, you acknowledge that you have read this disclosure and understand the risks associated with trading $NEIRO.\"\n}"},{"id":"30000002879","value":"{\n  \"title\": \"Trading $FLOKI\",\n  \"content\": \"Floki ($FLOKI) is a community driven memecoin on the Ethereum ecosystem. As a meme token, its value may be derived only from continued market demand and trading activity, which may result in the potential for permanent and total loss of value should participants choose to no longer demand or trade $FLOKI. The token may also be subject to extreme price volatilit